      "name": "Game",
      "filePath": "game.py",
      "lineRange": [
        569,
        830
      ],
      "summary": "Central control loop: registers agents, enforces per-agent startup/move timeouts and exception catching, solicits actions, applies successors, updates the display and lets rules detect wins and losses.",
